flowchart LR
    P[Player guess or question] --> A[app.py]
    A --> L[Glitch agent loop]
    L -->|plans| G[Gemini]
    G -->|calls tools| T[Python tools: game facts, patterns, math clues]
    T --> G
    G --> V[Validator]
    V -->|passes| A
    V -->|fails or API error| F[Rule-based fallback]
    F --> A
    L --> LOG[(logs/game_sessions.jsonl)]
